# Echo — 複製為專案根目錄的 .env 後修改 / Copy to .env in the project root and edit.
# 完整逐項說明 / Full field reference: docs/configuration.md (繁中), docs/configuration.en.md (English).
# 每行一項 NAME=value；# 開頭是註解 / One NAME=value per line; # starts a comment.
# 預設 HTTPS 部署須自備可管理 DNS 的網域或子網域。
# The default HTTPS deployment requires a domain or subdomain with DNS control.
# 沒有網域請自行上網搜尋「免費網域申請指南」，此處不提供申請教學。
# Without a domain, search online for a free domain registration guide; registration is not covered here.

# 手機連線使用的網域；從網域服務商的 DNS 控制台取得或設定。
# Public hostname for app connections; obtain/configure it in the domain provider's DNS console.
# 必須修改範例；只填主機名稱，不加 https://、連接埠或 /music。
# Replace the example; hostname only, without https://, a port or /music.
# 內建 HTTPS 需要 DNS 指向伺服器且 TCP 80/443 可達。
# Built-in HTTPS requires DNS pointing to the server and reachable TCP ports 80/443.
DOMAIN=music.example.com

# Compose 服務組合；https 會啟動內建 Caddy，申請及更新 HTTPS 憑證。
# Compose service profile; https starts Caddy to obtain and renew HTTPS certificates.
# 使用既有反向代理／Tunnel 時留空，改由該服務處理 HTTPS；無須另外申請此值。
# Leave blank for an existing reverse proxy/tunnel that handles HTTPS; this is a local setting.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=https

# Docker 主機的音樂資料夾，從伺服器／NAS 檔案管理器取得完整路徑。
# Music directory on the Docker host; get its full path from the server/NAS file manager.
# 掛載為容器 /music；需允許讀取音樂與寫入匯入歌曲。例：/srv/music。
# Mounted at /music in the container; requires music read/import write access. Example: /srv/music.
# ./music 是專案旁的 music 資料夾；使用既有音樂庫時修改此值。
# ./music is the music directory beside compose.yaml; change it for an existing library.
MUSIC_PATH=./music

# 每日分析、歌單與新歌池輪換的時區；從伺服器時區設定取得 IANA 名稱。
# Time zone for daily analysis, mixes and pool rotation; use an IANA name from server time settings.
# 例：Asia/Hong_Kong、Asia/Taipei、Europe/London；不可留空，勿填 UTC+8。
# Examples: Asia/Hong_Kong, Asia/Taipei, Europe/London; do not leave blank or use UTC+8.
TZ=Asia/Hong_Kong

# 主機 HTTP 連接埠的監聽介面，無須申請。127.0.0.1 僅供同主機代理使用。
# Host interface for the HTTP port; no registration needed. 127.0.0.1 allows host-local access.
# 0.0.0.0 允許其他機器連入，是否可達仍由防火牆決定；內建 HTTPS 保留預設。
# 0.0.0.0 accepts connections from other machines, subject to the firewall; keep default for built-in HTTPS.
BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1

# 主機上的 HTTP 連接埠；被佔用時自行選未使用的埠，例如 18083。
# Host HTTP port; choose an unused port such as 18083 if occupied.
# 不改變容器內的 18082，也不改變內建 HTTPS 的 80/443；一般保留預設。
# Does not change container port 18082 or built-in HTTPS ports 80/443; normally keep default.
HTTP_PORT=18082

# 聆聽行為分析渠道，分析完成、重播與跳過記錄；按 API key 所屬渠道選擇。
# Provider for listening behavior analysis (completion, repeats, skips); match it to the API key issuer.
# 選項 / Options: gemini | openai | deepseek | qwen | custom | none
# custom 使用 OpenAI Chat Completions 相容端點；none 停用行為 AI。勿留空。
# custom uses an OpenAI Chat Completions endpoint; none disables behavioral AI. Do not leave blank.
AI_PROVIDER=gemini

# AI 服務的 API 根位址，從渠道的 API 文件／控制台取得；不是 Echo 的 DOMAIN。
# AI API base URL from provider docs/console; this is not Echo's DOMAIN.
# gemini/openai/deepseek 可留空使用內建網址；qwen/custom 必填。
# gemini/openai/deepseek may be blank for official defaults; qwen/custom require a URL.
# OpenAI 例：https://api.openai.com/v1；不加 /chat/completions，勿填聊天網站位址。
# OpenAI example: https://api.openai.com/v1; omit /chat/completions and do not use a chat website URL.
AI_BASE_URL=

# 模型的 API ID，從渠道模型清單取得；選支援文字輸入及 JSON 回覆的模型。
# Model API ID from the provider's model list; requires text input and JSON output.
# 留空使用渠道預設；custom 必填。預設清單與官方模型文件見 docs/ai-providers.md。
# Blank selects a provider preset; required for custom. Presets/model links: docs/ai-providers.md.
AI_MODEL=

# API key 是渠道簽發的呼叫憑證，於以下入口建立；不是登入密碼或 Echo 的存取金鑰。
# API keys are provider-issued credentials; create them below. They are not passwords or Echo access keys.
# Gemini: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# OpenAI: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# DeepSeek: https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
# Qwen: https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/get-api-key
# custom：向端點提供者取得 / custom: obtain from the endpoint operator.
# 需有模型權限與可用 API 額度；收費按渠道規定。無 key 時保持 []，行為 AI 不啟用。
# Model access and available API quota are required; provider pricing applies. [] disables behavioral AI.
# 單組 / One: AI_API_KEYS='["your-key"]'（亦接受單一字串 / a single literal key is also accepted）
# 多組 / Multiple: AI_API_KEYS='["first-key","second-key","third-key"]'
# 同池只放同渠道、同端點的 key；重複 key 去除後輪替，429 會暫停該池。
# One provider/endpoint per pool; unique keys rotate, while HTTP 429 pauses the pool.
# 不可填 key1,key2 或 [key1,key2]；每組需為 JSON 雙引號字串。
# Do not use key1,key2 or [key1,key2]; every array item must be a double-quoted JSON string.
# 外層單引號保護 $ 等字元不被 Compose 展開 / Outer single quotes protect literal $ characters.
AI_API_KEYS='[]'

# 行為 AI 的 HTTP(S) 代理；可直連時留空。位址從已安裝的代理軟體設定／管理員取得。
# HTTP(S) proxy for behavioral AI; blank uses a direct connection. Get it from proxy settings/admin.
# 是否需要 VPN／代理取決於伺服器網路及渠道支援地區，見 docs/ai-providers.md。
# VPN/proxy needs depend on server networking and provider regions; see docs/ai-providers.md.
# OpenAI/Gemini 有地區限制；DeepSeek/Qwen 通常可於中國大陸直連，仍須核對端點及帳戶。
# OpenAI/Gemini have region restrictions; DeepSeek/Qwen are commonly reachable in mainland China; check endpoint/account.
# 代理範例：http://host.docker.internal:7890；須已存在且容器可達，填入不會建立代理。
# Example: http://host.docker.internal:7890; the proxy must exist and be reachable from Docker.
# 僅接受不含帳密、查詢參數的 HTTP(S) URL；不接受 SOCKS URL 或 VPN 訂閱連結。
# HTTP(S) URLs only, without credentials/query parameters; no SOCKS URLs or VPN subscription links.
AI_PROXY_URL=

# 實際音訊片段的分析渠道，用於曲風等聆聽線索；音訊會傳送至指定渠道。
# Provider for actual audio excerpts and musical characteristics; clips are sent to this provider.
# 選項 / Options: auto | none | gemini | openai | custom
# auto 或留空：主渠道為 Gemini/OpenAI 時啟用音訊，其他主渠道停用音訊。
# auto or blank: enable audio for a Gemini/OpenAI main provider; disable it for other main providers.
# none 只關閉音訊分析；行為分析仍按 AI_PROVIDER 設定執行。
# none disables audio analysis only; behavioral analysis follows AI_PROVIDER.
AUDIO_AI_PROVIDER=auto

# 音訊 API 根位址，取得方式同 AI_BASE_URL；custom 必填或由相同渠道繼承。
# Audio API base from provider docs, like AI_BASE_URL; custom requires a URL or same-provider inheritance.
# 留空：同渠道繼承 AI_BASE_URL，否則使用音訊渠道的官方預設。
# Blank: reuse AI_BASE_URL for the same provider, otherwise use the audio provider's official default.
AUDIO_AI_BASE_URL=

# 音訊模型 API ID，從渠道模型文件確認音訊輸入支援；custom 必填。
# Audio model API ID from provider model docs; verify audio input support. Required for custom.
# 留空：同渠道且同 URL 的 Gemini 沿用 AI_MODEL；其他 Gemini 使用預設模型。
# Blank: Gemini reuses AI_MODEL only for the same provider and URL; otherwise it uses its default model.
# OpenAI 預設 gpt-audio-1.5；OpenAI 相容音訊端點須支援 input_audio MP3。
# OpenAI defaults to gpt-audio-1.5; compatible audio endpoints must support MP3 input_audio.
AUDIO_AI_MODEL=

# 向音訊渠道申請 API key，入口及格式同 AI_API_KEYS。
# Obtain keys from the audio provider; portals and format are the same as AI_API_KEYS.
# 留空僅在渠道且 URL 相同時繼承 AI_API_KEYS；不同渠道／URL 需另填。
# Blank inherits AI_API_KEYS only for the same provider AND URL; otherwise supply separate keys.
# [] 明確停用此音訊 key 池，不會繼承 / [] explicitly disables this audio key pool without inheritance.
AUDIO_AI_API_KEYS=

# 音訊請求的 HTTP(S) 代理，從代理軟體設定／管理員取得，格式同 AI_PROXY_URL。
# HTTP(S) proxy for audio requests from proxy settings/admin; same format as AI_PROXY_URL.
# 留空：渠道且 URL 相同時繼承 AI_PROXY_URL，否則直連。
# Blank: inherit AI_PROXY_URL only for the same provider AND URL; otherwise connect directly.
AUDIO_AI_PROXY_URL=

# YouTube 搜尋與匯入使用的代理，從代理軟體設定／管理員取得，不繼承 AI 代理。
# Proxy for YouTube search/import from proxy settings/admin; does not inherit AI proxy settings.
# 未指定時由 yt-dlp 使用預設網路設定；可正常連線時留空。
# Blank leaves networking to yt-dlp defaults; leave blank if YouTube is reachable.
# 例 / Example: http://host.docker.internal:7890
YOUTUBE_PROXY_URL=

# 選填：來源要求登入時使用的瀏覽器登入資料檔；無需登入時留空。
# Optional browser login-session file for sources requiring authentication; otherwise leave blank.
# 從自己的瀏覽器匯出 Netscape 格式，方法：https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/wiki/FAQ#how-do-i-pass-cookies-to-yt-dlp
# Export Netscape cookies from your browser; export instructions are at the official FAQ URL above.
# 將 cookies.txt 放在專案根目錄，按 docs/deployment.md 掛載後填容器路徑。
# Put cookies.txt in the project root, mount it as in docs/deployment.md, then enter the container path.
# 例：/run/echo/cookies.txt；僅填路徑不會上傳或掛載檔案。
# Example: /run/echo/cookies.txt; setting a path alone does not upload or mount the file.
YOUTUBE_COOKIES_FILE=
